  author = {Fan Huang and Xiongkuo Min and Zhichao Ma and Xiaohong Liu and Chris Wei Zhou and Guangtao Zhai and Junjie Gao and Runze Liu and Yingzhe Peng and Shujian Yang and Jin Zhang and Kai Yang and Zhiyuan You and Michael Ao and Yicheng Wu and Weixia Zhang and Junlin Chen and Wei Sun and Zhihua Wang and Zhe Zhang and Yang Yang and Mingying Bai and Jiawang Du and Zilong Lu and Zhenyu Jiang and Ziguan Cui and Zongliang Gan and Guijin Tang and Fan Yang and Hang Ouyang and Zhuohang Shi and Tianxin Xiao and Zhizun Luo and Zhaowang Wu and Kaixin Deng and Ruikun Zhang and Hao Yang and Liyuan Pan},
